<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harnischfeger started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harnischfeger started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber confirmed it initiated coverage of Harnischfeger Industries Inc as neutral.</p>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it expects Harnischfeger to earn $3.74 a share in 1997 and $4.46 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said current stock price reflects fair value for the company.</p>
<p>-- the stock closed Wednesday at 45-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
